      // Renderers update text nodes frequently.  Ignore text-only mutations so
      // localization cannot observe its own writes and start a repaint loop.
      // Limit the remaining enhancement observer to the application content;
      // login/header changes and background shell work do not need a full-page
      // scan.  A single microtask pass handles all late-created rows/panels
      // before the browser gets a chance to paint an untranslated frame.
